      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9172055cab0eda5b",
      "translationZh": "作者：Olga Tsymboi , Dmitrii Stoianov , Ramil Latypov , Danil Taranets , Daniil Dryabin , Mikhail Gashkov , Viktor Zelenkovskiy , Aleksandr Fida , Gleb Alektorov , Nikita Gulyakov , Arthur Babkin , Aleksandr Medvedev , Pavel Gein , Anatolii Potapov",
